  "preregistration_frozen_part_sha256": "0a5c7e061be57d24f382f24594c7d83a1ec68a4365ec6590c316d1d351ba0c85",
  "notes": [
    "The 17 protected blobs of the 2026-11-15 checkpoint plus the fast, matrix-free, dense-output, lagged and client-stage drivers and the adaptive controller.",
    "The 2026-11-15 checker stops passing once selection.rs changes; this checkpoint is the authority for loop L1.",
    "A passed trial merge (V02) replaces protected_blob_sha1 in a recorded step.",
    "Wave 1: golden oracle merged; trial merge not adopted (gates T2, T3 strict, T6 fail); V15 code stays on its branch.",
    "Epoch 2 starts at the adoption content commit; protected blobs are the post-merge bytes. The 2026-11-15 checker no longer applies.",
    "2026-11-17 wave 2 group 1: nodes V04, V06 (stage a) and V07 (stage a) merged after independent review; 10 implemented source files and 12 evidence files added to the identity lists. Stage-client stubs krylov.rs and speculative.rs are now implementations.",
    "2026-11-17: stage-client stub dense_lu_reuse.rs pre-seeded for node V18; mod.rs gains its module line.",
    "2026-11-23: node V21 stage b: opt-in stage client banded_tight.rs with its identity and allocation tests added by the orchestrator session; mod.rs gains its module line and re-export.",
    "2026-11-23 wave 2 group 2: nodes V03a, V17 and V16 merged after independent review (run wf_f2599e6f-a4a); 12 implemented source files and 12 evidence files added to or updated in the identity lists (stage_clients/krylov.rs changed by V17). Result files of the banded nodes V19 and V21 are added when their last measurements are in.",
    "2026-11-23: result files of the orchestrator-run nodes V19 (KILL) and V21 (PASS) added to the evidence list after their last measurements.",
    "2026-11-23: owner decisions OD-L1-9 to OD-L1-12 appended to OWNER_DECISIONS_20261116.json; its identity is updated.",
    "2026-11-23: epoch 3 opened. It holds the edits of protected files that the owner approved on 2026-11-23 (OD-L1-9 to OD-L1-12); the pins of epoch 2 are kept in the list of epochs. First edit, under OD-L1-12: workspace version 0.1.0 -> 0.2.0 in Cargo.toml and the six workspace package entries of Cargo.lock that take that version; no dependency changed.",
    "2026-11-23, epoch 3, node V22 under OD-L1-9: rodas5p_fast.rs gains one public function, rodas5p_fast_dense.rs two public functions, one identifier and a kernel parameter on two private functions (no existing public function changes), and crates/vigilode/src/lib.rs gains one re-export and a paragraph of route documentation. The sentinel test keeps its pins and allows one more lib.rs block (banded_kernel_route/SENTINEL_REPIN.json). The width constant of the facade is provisional (8) until the deciding series of the width scan.",
